        "reasons": "Every link is established on the card: directory email reach to 260 gyms, a current signal plus the insurer's annual-renewal requirement, a $380 evidenced price, conversion measured on this offer's own sales (14/120 = 11.7%), Brain-produced fulfilment, $8 cost with $0 exposure, and 5-day settlement. The arithmetic checks: 9 x $380 = $3,420 gross; less 9 x $8 = $72 leaves $3,348 net; the receipt on day 10 settles on day 15. The author correctly excludes the 120 gyms already contacted. At the measured rate the 140 uncontacted gyms give about 16 acceptances against the 9 needed. The author also correctly treats Brain's 260-per-month volume reading as too generous for annual buyers. Costs are paid from settled receipts, so the $0 exposure cap is kept. The owner can act on it.",
